，五月迁官","precision":"undated","basis":"保留原纪年及粒度；本账户未独立归一公元年，不继承相邻事件年份。","evidence":["fangji-q-67796af30a6716794fed"]},"ordering_evidence":"fangji-q-67796af30a6716794fed","order":6009}],"persons":[{"id":"fangji-p-49f7316c9946ff","name":"王弘直","evidence":["fangji-q-715ae159791321ea5fcc","fangji-q-39e6b0cb194ed5a568a5","fangji-q-67796af30a6716794fed"],"facts":[],"mentions":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"fangji-q-39e6b0cb194ed5a568a5","section":"chapter-029","block":"b-49c2f911f8eccf7f833e","layer":"original","quote":"直问其故，辂曰：“其日乙卯〖7〗，则长子之候也〖8〗；木落于申〖9〗，斗建申〖10〗，申破寅〖11〗，死丧之候也〖12〗；日加午而风发〖13〗，则马之候也〖14〗；离为文章〖15〗，则吏之候也〖16〗；申未为虎〖17〗，虎为大人，则父之候也","section_title":"方伎传第二十九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0064.xhtml","index":310,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":120,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"fangji-q-67796af30a6716794fed","section":"chapter-029","block":"b-37260d3bb96c4c24e28d","layer":"original","quote":"有雄雉飞来，登直内铃柱头。直大以不安，令辂作卦。辂曰：“到五月必迁。”时三月也：至期，直果为勃海太守","section_title":"方伎传第二十九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0064.xhtml","index":311,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":50,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"fangji-q-715ae159791321ea5fcc","section":"chapter-029","block":"b-0991db0fc23195dd8733","layer":"original","quote":"辂至列人典农王弘直许〖1〗。有飘风高三尺余，从申上来〖2〗，在庭中幢幢回转〖3〗；息已，复起，良久乃止。直以问骆，辂曰：“东方当有马吏至〖4〗；恐父哭子，如何〖5〗！”明日胶东吏到〖6〗，直子果亡","section_title":"方伎传第二十九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0064.xhtml","index":309,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":98,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
